# Verify and Update Rules Workflow

1. Analyze the batch flow to understand rule evaluation frequency and triggers.
2. Identify when `createOrUpdateRule()` is invoked and what it does based on memory metadata.
3. Understand how rules are updated only for relevant memories, not all at once.
4. Recognize that background decay applies only to existing rules and touches no new ones.
